Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.38,0:00:06.10,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,The hunters who came to investigate the \Nanomalies surrounding the White Wolf's Den
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.10,0:00:09.84,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,learned that a branch of the mage association \NAkashic Tower was behind it—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:13.14,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,specifically, a group lead \Nby Noctus Cochlear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.98,0:00:12.73,Top,Sitri,0,0,0,,Mages, supporting fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:26.29,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,The culmination of our research: "Akasha."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.29,0:00:29.50,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,The ultimate weapon that \Nwill destroy you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.71,0:00:44.89,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Gark!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:55.50,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,We're getting nowhere fast like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:56.97,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,We need to get out there, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.97,0:00:57.61,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.61,0:00:59.44,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,There are non-combatants here as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.44,0:01:01.69,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,If we overextend ourselves, \Nwe'll suffer casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.45,0:01:04.82,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:17.59,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,He's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.09,0:01:21.09,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Sven!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.34,0:01:22.72,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.72,0:01:24.20,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Keep the pressure on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.20,0:01:26.70,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,If we could take down just one...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.63,0:01:32.26,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.26,0:01:34.97,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Krai, I'm falling in love again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.97,0:01:35.98,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Liz?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.98,0:01:37.23,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Stifled Shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.23,0:01:38.60,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Sis?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.32,0:01:40.62,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.94,0:01:43.62,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Guys, reinforcements from \Nthe Master have arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.62,0:01:45.51,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Let's go crush them!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.96,0:01:51.42,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,We are now in the golden age \Nof the treasure hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:54.57,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Amid the sparkling talent on \Ndisplay in the capital of Zebrudia,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.57,0:01:57.20,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,there was one man who stood \Nout amongst all others!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.62,0:01:59.75,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,His name is Krai Andrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.75,0:02:02.34,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,This is an epic tale \Nfull of glory and agony,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.34,0:02:04.40,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,of how he became renowned \Nfor being the leader
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.40,0:02:07.33,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,of the strongest party he founded \Nwith his childhood friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.33,0:02:10.48,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,and also the master of the strongest clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.90,0:03:28.85,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,This is my partner in crime, Hail's Tusk!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.85,0:03:31.52,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Anybody who wants to be \Nencased in ice, come at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.52,0:03:34.52,EpTitle,txt,0,0,0,,{\c&H00BAFF&\pos(320.52,100.623)}Episode 09
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.52,0:03:34.52,EpTitle,txt,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\pos(322.143,238.714)\c&HD1D1D1&}I Want to Teach Love and Peace
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:34.04,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,"I Want to Teach Love and Peace."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.20,0:03:53.00,Show Title,txt,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,700)\pos(324,269)\fscx95\fscy76}Let This Grieving Soul Retire
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.45,0:04:06.38,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I guess she took off...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:08.14,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I guess she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.14,0:04:11.76,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Liz is supposed to be my bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.76,0:04:12.65,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.65,0:04:13.39,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.39,0:04:15.44,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,There's something close.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.44,0:04:16.39,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.66,0:04:18.33,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,There are multiple living beings nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.09,0:04:21.78,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,It seems they've noticed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.78,0:04:23.18,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Shall we capture them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.99,0:04:26.67,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I think we can just ignore them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.67,0:04:29.24,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Oh, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:29.97,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.30,0:04:33.41,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It's natural for animals \Nto be in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.41,0:04:36.16,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,If anything, I feel bad for messing \Nup the place they call home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.16,0:04:37.91,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Love and peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:39.51,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Well, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.51,0:04:40.92,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:43.75,Internal,Flick(M),0,0,0,,What is the meaning of \Nthis, Thousand Tricks?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.75,0:04:46.06,Internal,Flick(M),0,0,0,,You are well aware of our \Npresence, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.18,0:04:48.82,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.82,0:04:50.43,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.43,0:04:52.43,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:54.84,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'll let you take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:04:56.68,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'll follow your lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.68,0:04:57.60,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.60,0:04:59.54,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Your wish is my command, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.04,0:05:02.48,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.48,0:05:03.67,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yup, yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.33,0:05:06.45,Internal,Sophia(M),0,0,0,,No matter how well-crafted your plans are,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.45,0:05:08.94,Internal,Sophia(M),0,0,0,,unexpected things will always happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.35,0:05:12.63,Internal,Sophia(M),0,0,0,,Unwanted changes to your \Nstrategy in the field...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.63,0:05:14.94,Internal,Sophia(M),0,0,0,,Repeated insubordination \Nfrom disciples...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.40,0:05:19.84,Internal,Sophia(M),0,0,0,,And then, the worst imaginable \Nreinforcement for the Malice Eaters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.78,0:05:26.78,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're \Nstruggling against this trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.78,0:05:28.71,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Si, you suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.71,0:05:31.72,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Sis, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:34.07,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I begged Krai to let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.15,0:05:41.27,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.27,0:05:43.33,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,That's so hard. Impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.46,0:05:52.94,Internal,Sophia(M),0,0,0,,I suspected those disciples would not be \Nable to unleash Akasha's abilities properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.15,0:05:55.62,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Not going to fall behind here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.62,0:05:58.47,Internal,Sophia(M),0,0,0,,This will fail to be a test \Nof Akasha's abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.86,0:06:22.69,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Stop playing with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.28,0:06:24.48,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.37,0:06:27.49,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,That's impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.49,0:06:29.74,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,That huge thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.31,0:06:32.75,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,It's basically like Ansem!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:37.00,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,You know, they {\i1}do{\i0} look \Naround the same height.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.00,0:06:38.56,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Was he the model?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.53,0:06:50.86,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,It even has ranged attacks?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:53.02,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.59,0:06:57.50,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Sitri!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.50,0:06:58.65,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Got anything up your sleeve?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.65,0:07:01.65,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,We're lucky it doesn't have \Nany area-of-effect attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:06:59.75,Top,Liz,0,0,0,,Geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.75,0:07:01.39,Top,Liz,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.39,0:07:03.43,Top,Liz,0,0,0,,Why is only coming after me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:05.00,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,My sister isn't very strong against those.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.43,0:07:05.62,Top,Liz,0,0,0,,I'll kill you for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.26,0:07:08.05,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Her opponent is extremely durable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.05,0:07:11.44,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Since she's specialized for speed, \Nshe won't be able to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.44,0:07:16.19,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,We might have to go into overtime and \Nwait until the golem runs out of mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.19,0:07:17.30,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.30,0:07:18.88,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I'll pulverize it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.88,0:07:19.78,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.78,0:07:23.81,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.31,0:07:30.35,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,That worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:43.57,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,What the hell did they build?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:48.73,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Damn, I thought I could defeat it quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.72,0:07:51.58,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Ugh! It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.51,0:07:54.33,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Time's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.33,0:07:57.14,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Stifled Shadow. What do you mean, "over"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.14,0:07:59.44,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,What are guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:02.46,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Krai?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.82,0:08:05.33,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh. Hi, Sven! Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.33,0:08:08.04,Default,Gein,0,0,0,,So that's Thousand Tricks?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.04,0:08:09.34,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:14.97,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I really wanted to finish him off before \Nyou showed up, but he's so tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.97,0:08:17.22,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yep, sure looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.10,0:08:19.49,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.49,0:08:21.12,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,It really is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.23,0:08:25.96,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Krai, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.96,0:08:26.99,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.27,0:08:28.99,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.99,0:08:32.21,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,Master, it's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.46,0:08:32.21,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yep, sure looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.74,0:08:51.99,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,That was awesome, Krai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.99,0:08:53.26,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.26,0:08:55.51,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I didn't see it at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.51,0:08:56.39,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.39,0:08:57.50,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Hey, Ti!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:08:59.01,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Why are you hanging off of him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.62,0:09:03.71,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Sorry, it was kinda dark, \Nand I couldn't see very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.71,0:09:04.56,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.56,0:09:05.33,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.13,0:09:11.57,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Just as I thought, the Akashic \NTower guys have escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.57,0:09:15.15,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,That they have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.15,0:09:19.36,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Speaking of, what did Krai end \Nup doing there at the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.36,0:09:20.57,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Did he use a relic?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.57,0:09:26.74,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,In his own words, "I think it just \Nflew off by itself. Like, boing."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.74,0:09:27.93,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.93,0:09:29.57,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Like hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:32.13,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.13,0:09:35.20,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,We confiscated their \Ndocuments and materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.20,0:09:38.85,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,We'll leave the rest to the Institute for \NRelic Research and the Knight's Order.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.85,0:09:42.36,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Thank you for the reinforcement, Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.36,0:09:45.39,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,They were much stronger than anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.39,0:09:46.59,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.59,0:09:51.02,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,That was just Liz running off at \Nthe perfect time, but whatever...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.45,0:09:54.50,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,C'mon, do it like you mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.50,0:09:56.35,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.33,0:09:59.11,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,So, this mage association,\NSomething-Or-Another Tower...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.42,0:10:01.61,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Your arch-nemesis is with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.61,0:10:03.18,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,They're called the Akashic Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.18,0:10:04.71,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.71,0:10:06.51,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Is there anything I can do to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.51,0:10:08.41,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.41,0:10:09.37,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:14.26,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I think I'll try to settle \Nthe score myself first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.84,0:10:16.87,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.87,0:10:21.52,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,You're telling me that Sophia has \Ninfiltrated Thousand Tricks' clan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.52,0:10:23.18,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,It's unmistakable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.18,0:10:24.85,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,That's definitely her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.85,0:10:25.40,Default,Hos,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.40,0:10:26.20,Default,Tage,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.20,0:10:28.44,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,And have they noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.44,0:10:29.67,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.67,0:10:32.92,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,It is also possible that they are aware \Nand just observing her moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.02,0:10:36.91,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,He easily saw through the anomalies \Nat the White Wolf's Den,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.26,0:10:40.15,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,knew about the existence of our \Nbase and still ignored it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.58,0:10:44.03,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,left this matter to his underlings \Nuntil the last moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.03,0:10:46.86,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,and then let you escape \Nwhile laughing about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:50.91,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,I simply cannot fathom\Nwhat he is thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.55,0:10:53.75,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.19,0:10:57.89,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Trying to keep up with him would be foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.89,0:10:59.74,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,We will leave Zebrudia at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.74,0:11:00.53,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.53,0:11:02.51,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,If we continue our search for the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.51,0:11:05.18,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,I'm sure an opportunity for \Na comeback will present itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.63,0:11:07.72,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Call Sophia back at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.41,0:11:10.47,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,Sitri's Slime...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.47,0:11:12.49,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,If I could just find that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.55,0:11:16.57,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Enough is enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.90,0:11:18.59,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,You set all these things into motion,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.59,0:11:21.44,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,and you still want me to believe \Nthat you don't know anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.79,0:11:23.44,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,That's what I'm saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.44,0:11:26.65,Default,Adoria,0,0,0,,Thousand Tricks, your penchant \Nfor secrecy is going too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.66,0:11:28.79,Default,Adoria,0,0,0,,We acknowledge your intelligence network
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.79,0:11:32.17,Default,Adoria,0,0,0,,surpasses even our own, \Ndespite our governmental affiliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.17,0:11:33.47,Default,Adoria,0,0,0,,But {\i1}this{\i0} incident
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.47,0:11:35.72,Default,Adoria,0,0,0,,is beyond the scope \Nof your "Thousand Trials."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:36.79,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.79,0:11:41.20,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,How did me being an incompetent leader\N turn into official government business?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:45.46,Default,Adoria,0,0,0,,Noctus Cochlear's experiments \Namount to felonies in the empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:48.52,Default,Adoria,0,0,0,,Therefore, as a citizen, \Nyou are obligated to cooperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.52,0:11:49.76,Default,Adoria,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.76,0:11:53.31,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Then you should talk to Sitri, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.31,0:11:55.57,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I left this entire mission in her hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.33,0:11:57.45,Default,Adoria,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.45,0:12:01.79,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,I suppose you are hesitant to \Nofficially summon her for questioning?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.99,0:12:05.33,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,That incident three years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:08.11,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Had it not been for Branch\NManager Gark's efforts,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.11,0:12:10.99,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Sitri would have remained falsely accused.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.65,0:12:13.01,Default,Adoria,0,0,0,,That incident...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.27,0:12:15.48,Default,Adoria,0,0,0,,The circumstantial evidence \Nall pointed to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:18.93,Default,Adoria,0,0,0,,Her demotion and the second name "Deep Black,"\N branding her the worst of the worst...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.45,0:12:21.91,Default,Adoria,0,0,0,,We can't undo those things anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.91,0:12:25.88,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,South Isteria's mass prison break incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.16,0:12:30.25,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,The vile criminals that escaped \Nare all still at large.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.56,0:12:32.37,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,It was so ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.37,0:12:36.13,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,As if Sitri would ever be mixed \Nup in something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.25,0:12:39.57,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.57,0:12:41.29,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.98,0:12:43.18,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.18,0:12:44.41,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,You can drop the act now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.17,0:12:47.26,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,We're out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.26,0:12:49.15,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,We'll be leaving the capital immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.15,0:12:50.62,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,"Sophia"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.62,0:12:51.68,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,You're mistaken...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:53.80,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,I am Talia Wydman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.80,0:12:57.75,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,Maybe she cast a spell on herself so \NThousand Tricks can't unmask her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.75,0:13:00.17,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,Or perhaps she's lost her memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.17,0:13:01.98,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:09.69,Default,Both,0,0,0,,It's hostile towards Sophia!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.93,0:13:11.67,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.67,0:13:14.00,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,I told you... I'm Talia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:15.59,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,I have returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.70,0:13:19.76,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:22.19,Default,Talia,0,0,0,,Is that... me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.19,0:13:24.75,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,I apologize for being late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.75,0:13:26.96,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,There were a few things I had to clean up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.69,0:13:29.20,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:31.91,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Why are you not at all \Nsurprised to see a woman
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.91,0:13:33.95,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,who looks just like you, Sophia?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.95,0:13:36.92,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,Master, that's not quite it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:39.93,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,She is not the one who looks like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.52,0:13:46.67,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,I'm the one who looks like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.47,0:13:50.98,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,And you flatter me by saying \Nwe look exactly alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.33,0:13:55.49,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,If you take a closer look at us, you'll see \Ndifferences that could not be erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.83,0:13:59.85,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,My bust and height are both \Nslightly larger than hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.85,0:14:02.36,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,Master, the key to a disguise...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.36,0:14:06.85,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,is to fully understand prominent features, \Nand then replicate the gist of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.33,0:14:11.63,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,People are often looking, \Nbut they usually aren't {\i1}seeing{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.68,0:14:15.37,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.62,0:14:17.50,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,Sitri Smart!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.99,0:14:20.11,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,How dare you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.11,0:14:21.99,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,You turned yourself into \NSophia to come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.99,0:14:24.51,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,Incorrect again, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.07,0:14:27.75,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,Do you still not understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.75,0:14:30.01,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,I've been myself from the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.44,0:14:32.23,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,Ever since that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.81,0:14:37.64,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,Sophia Black has always been Sitri Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.70,0:14:41.75,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.75,0:14:43.15,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Are you saying, you—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.15,0:14:45.85,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,You planned to betray \Nus from the very start!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.85,0:14:47.75,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Please stop, Flick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.36,0:14:52.48,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,The reason I became a disciple is \Nbecause I was drawn by the abilities
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.48,0:14:55.19,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,of the Master of Mages, Noctus Cochlear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.19,0:14:57.28,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I'm no different than any of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:15:00.52,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I respect our master.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.39,0:15:05.93,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,For his relentlessly inquisitive mind, \Nhis dedication, and his abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.36,0:15:12.68,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,He also gathered a plethora of expensive\N equipment and precious materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.03,0:15:17.14,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I can't even fathom how much time, money,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.14,0:15:21.06,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,and risk it would have taken for me to build \Nthe agitation device or Akasha by myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.39,0:15:24.31,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,But the jig is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:30.15,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Krai letting all of you go\N was his warning to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.15,0:15:34.33,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,"It's dangerous, so you better \Ncall it quits and come home."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.56,0:15:39.95,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,You're saying that Thousand Tricks knew \Nyou were taking part in our research,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.95,0:15:40.74,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,and deliberately—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:44.49,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Please don't misunderstand. \NI didn't tell him anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.40,0:15:49.33,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,But Krai is able to see through everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.33,0:15:51.34,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,You can't hide anything from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.54,0:15:54.29,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Krai is a very kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.29,0:15:57.35,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,He set the stage while I was gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.35,0:16:02.37,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,sending high-level hunters to give me a \Nchance to test the fruits of our research.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.37,0:16:06.49,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Of course, Akasha's abilities \Nleft nothing to be desired!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.49,0:16:10.88,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,But when he arrived in person, I made \Nit jump back by itself. Like, boing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.37,0:16:15.28,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,If the battle had continued, it would \Nhave led to more damage and casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.28,0:16:17.24,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,This was enough for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.51,0:16:20.24,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,All the results of our \Nresearch were confiscated,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.53,0:16:23.74,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,and you will all be \Napprehended as criminals...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.15,0:16:27.81,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,But I will carry on, so please don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:31.01,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,You're insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.63,0:16:35.51,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,You really think the end\N—the research—justifies all means?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.51,0:16:38.13,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,No wonder you were a \Nsuspect in that incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.13,0:16:39.59,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Deep Black!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.37,0:16:43.52,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I really hate that second name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.05,0:16:46.77,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,It's proof of my past failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.89,0:16:52.21,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I never said\Nanything to you, Talia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.21,0:16:54.19,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,It's something I've learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.19,0:16:58.53,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,If I become too visible, eventually \Nit'll become a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.03,0:17:04.15,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Your hair and eyes are pretty, \Nso they stand out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.84,0:17:07.80,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,That's why I figured becoming \Nyou would be the easiest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:14.34,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Sophia Black will now cease to exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.34,0:17:16.79,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,along with the second name I hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.05,0:17:21.18,Sign,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(522,1)\bord2\u1\fs20\pos(155.536,218.705)}Sitri Smart{\fs15\u0}\NHunter level 2
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.19,0:17:18.32,Top,Sitri,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:21.18,Top,Sitri,0,0,0,,From now on, you get to\Nbe the "Worst of the Worst"...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.18,0:17:21.18,Sign,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(275,1)\bord2\fs15\pos(157.822,200.42)}"Worst of the Worst"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:23.14,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,"Deep Black."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.02,0:17:25.31,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,Why, you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.75,0:17:29.55,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.76,0:17:34.33,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Living beings won't act on logic alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.33,0:17:36.54,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,They need love.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.54,0:17:39.55,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,That is, love and peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.58,0:17:41.87,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,What a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.05,0:17:55.60,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Please listen to me, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.60,0:17:57.76,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Th-This can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.76,0:18:01.61,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Nobody can be completely unscathed \Nafter being hit by my Kaiser Flame...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.81,0:18:02.77,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Sheesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.77,0:18:04.85,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,For the last time, please listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.35,0:18:08.61,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,There's a reason why \NI didn't get hurt at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.87,0:18:11.08,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,It's the result of my own research.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.75,0:18:13.72,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Contrary to the transmogrified phantoms,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.72,0:18:17.56,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,this here absorbs mana \Nmaterial and magic to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:20.25,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I call it Sitri's Slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.48,0:18:22.35,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,A slime?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.35,0:18:26.25,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,If it eats mana material \Nto grow, that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:29.93,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,it will devour everything in this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.93,0:18:31.51,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Are you even aware?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:34.32,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,That's why I'd like to test its abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.32,0:18:36.70,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I'm truly lucky till the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.70,0:18:41.16,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I mean, I get to test this cutie \Non mages as powerful as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.77,0:18:45.70,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,Master! Please run!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.70,0:18:46.88,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,We'll handle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.21,0:18:49.38,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,My disciples, I leave this in your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.38,0:18:50.29,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.88,0:18:52.84,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Are you sure, Flick?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.84,0:18:57.39,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Dying for someone who heavily favored \Nthe newcomer Sophia instead of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.39,0:19:02.17,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Someone who hurt your pride so badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.17,0:19:04.27,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,We're nothing like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.27,0:19:08.03,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,No matter how he treats us, we \Nhave nothing but respect for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.03,0:19:09.66,Default,Others,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.03,0:19:09.66,Top,Others,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:10.91,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.16,0:19:14.03,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,I will not let your sacrifice \Nas my disciples be in vain...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.42,0:19:26.72,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:31.94,Default,Killiam,0,0,0,,Kill, kill, kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.82,0:19:36.95,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,What in the world are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.62,0:19:41.96,Default,Killiam,0,0,0,,Kill, kill, kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:46.92,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,As the weakest member of the Grievers, \NI needed to get my hands on power quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:49.60,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,A golem takes a lot of time and resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.60,0:19:51.96,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,So I figured, what about a chimera?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:53.96,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's {\i0}a chimera?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.28,0:19:56.65,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I wanted high-quality materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.30,0:20:00.39,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,That prison really was ideal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.79,0:20:03.47,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Are you saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.84,0:20:05.76,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I let so many of them out,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.76,0:20:09.46,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,but when I gathered the usable \Nparts, it was only enough for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:11.46,Top,Killiam,0,0,0,,Kill, kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.13,0:20:12.31,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,But it's pretty amazing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.31,0:20:14.19,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I called it Killiam!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.09,0:20:18.62,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Deep Black... You...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.62,0:20:21.78,Top,Killiam,0,0,0,,Kill, kill, kill, kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.99,0:20:26.86,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,The magic materials from a great \Nsage are hard to come by, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.78,0:20:24.16,Top,Killiam,0,0,0,,Kill, kill, kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.16,0:20:26.88,Top,Killiam,0,0,0,,Kill, kill, kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.88,0:20:31.12,Default,Killiam,0,0,0,,Kill, kill, kill, kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.12,0:20:33.55,Default,Killiam,0,0,0,,kill, kill, kill, kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.34,0:20:39.87,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,So those guys from the Something-Or-Another\N Tower have all lost their memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.26,0:20:44.76,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,They confiscated chimeras and golems \Nand all kinds of other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.76,0:20:47.89,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,They probably did some weird experiment \Nthat blew up in their own faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.89,0:20:50.91,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I heard one of our people \Ngot mixed up in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.91,0:20:52.82,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,If you mean Talia, she's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.82,0:20:56.48,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,She's suffering from a lapse in memory,\N but its nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.48,0:20:58.50,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.23,0:21:02.21,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,It's too bad about Noctus Cochlear,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.21,0:21:04.56,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,but in the end, you do need a perpetrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.98,0:21:07.15,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I'll get my materials next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.47,0:21:09.73,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, yes. Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.25,0:21:12.50,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I have no idea what she's talking about,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.50,0:21:14.63,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,but I never do, so whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.92,0:21:18.46,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,So, the confiscated research materials \Nwill eventually be sold off
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.46,0:21:22.09,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,by the Institute for Relic Research.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.09,0:21:26.47,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,If possible, I'd like for us to get our hands \Non the Akasha golem and the Malice Eaters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.87,0:21:30.60,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Golem and... water?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:32.37,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Is she talking about a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.77,0:21:34.84,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Sure, I'll negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.84,0:21:36.44,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.80,0:21:38.55,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh, that reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.55,0:21:40.89,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Whatever happened to that\Narch-nemesis of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.89,0:21:41.99,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Did you catch her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.65,0:21:44.44,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,No. She...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.87,0:21:48.49,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,has gone far away and will \Nnever show her face here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.01,0:21:50.88,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I used colored water.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.00,0:23:34.01,EpTitle,txt,0,0,0,,{\fs15\pos(475.016,354.111)}By: Sitri and Killiam and Talia
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.32,0:23:31.14,Top,Killiam,0,0,0,,Kill, kill, kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.80,0:23:22.20,Top,Talia,0,0,0,,Sitri, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.20,0:23:23.47,Top,Talia,0,0,0,,Who is this person?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.47,0:23:24.55,Top,Sitri,0,0,0,,It's Killiam!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.97,0:23:26.80,Top,Sitri,0,0,0,,Strong in the face of a terrifying threat,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.80,0:23:28.09,Top,Sitri,0,0,0,,you're too sturdy, you berserker.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.09,0:23:31.12,Top,Sitri,0,0,0,,Just arrived in the capital today from another land!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.12,0:23:32.14,Top,Talia,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.50,0:23:34.44,Top,Sitri,0,0,0,,Next time on {\i1}Let This Grieving Soul{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.01,0:23:39.31,EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\c&H00BAFF&\pos(320.52,100.623)}Episode 10
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.01,0:23:39.31,EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\pos(322.143,238.714)\c&HD1D1D1&}I Want to Be Renowned in the Capital
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.44,0:23:35.54,Top,Talia,0,0,0,,...{\i1}Retire{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.54,0:23:36.90,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I want to kill, kill...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.54,0:23:39.30,Top,Killiam,0,0,0,,Kill, kill, kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.90,0:23:38.90,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,"I Want to Be Renowned in the Capital."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.99,0:23:47.69,Default,Arnold,0,0,0,,So this is the capital, Zebrudia, eh?
